      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for starting this. It feels a bit... wordy in some parts? Like it's trying too hard to be poetic. \n\nAlso, I noticed the score for this draft came back a bit low on the internal dashboard. It looks like it only caught about 8 or 9 of the features. Since the marketing team uses that score to decide which templates to actually use for the campaign, could you try to rewrite it to make sure you include more of the features from the list? \n\nI still need it to sound like a human wrote it, though. Don't just dump a list in the middle of the email, just try to weave more of them into the actual benefits so the score is higher.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
